@MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5298

### 1. Create a Vehicle
POST {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "licensePlate": "ND 123-456",
  "driverName": "Thabo",
  "maxLoadCapacity": 1500
}

### 2. Get All Vehicles
GET {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Vehicles
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create a Delivery Ticket (uses vehicleId: 1)
POST {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/DeliveryTickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveryAddress": "45 Nelson Mandela Dr, Ladysmith",
  "customerInfo": "Mica Hardware Site B",
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "status": 0
}

### 4. Get All Delivery Tickets (verify DTO shape)
GET {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/DeliveryTickets
Accept: application/json

### 5. Create a Ticket Item (uses deliveryTicketId: 1)
POST {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/TicketItems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemName": "50kg Cement Bags",
  "quantity": 10,
  "weightKg": 500.00,
  "deliveryTicketId": 1
}

### 6. Get All Ticket Items
GET {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/TicketItems
Accept: application/json

### 7. Create a POD Record (uses deliveryTicketId: 1)
POST {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/PodRecords
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "proofOfDelivery": "Photo_001.jpg",
  "receivedBy": "Sipho Dlamini",
  "receivedSignature": "S.Dlamini",
  "notes": "Left at main gate",
  "deliveryTicketId": 1
}

### 8. Get All POD Records
GET {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/PodRecords
Accept: application/json